Start with:

```jsx
function Toolbar() {
  return (
    <div>
      <button>Archive</button>
    </div>
  );
}
```

Create this parent handler:

```jsx
function Toolbar() {
  function handleArchive() {
    console.log("Archive requested");
  }

  return (
    <div>
      <button>Archive</button>
    </div>
  );
}
```

Now move the button into a child component called `ArchiveButton`, then pass the handler as `onArchive`.

